Chapter: LinLaunderBoundary
  cites Foreword chapter Linear

 Probe (closed by LinearOwnership stage 3): a linear value moves into
 a callee only through a parameter declared linear. Passing it to a
 plain parameter is CDX2065 - use freeze to exit deliberately.

Section: Definitions

  dup : Integer -> Integer
  dup (x) = x + x

  spend : linear Integer -> Integer
  spend (n) = dup n

  opening : Text = show (spend 21)

